{"school":{"dbn":"25Q120","name":"P.S. 120 Queens","boro":"Queens","district":"25","district_label":"District 25","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Elementary","grades":"PK-5","status":"open","enrollment":749,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"58-01 136 STREET, QUEENS, NY 11355","phone":"718-359-3390","website":"HTTPS://WWW.PS120Q.ORG/","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/kindergarten/63684","accessibility":"Partially Accessible","overview":"At P.S. 120Q, we are committed to helping all of our students develop the skills they need to succeed in today\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s world. Our goal is to create a supportive environment where students can follow their interests while learning how to contribute to their communities. By focusing on each child's unique needs, we ensure that everyone has the opportunity to learn and grow.\n\nWe encourage our students to take an active role in their learning, think critically, and solve problems. Our school offers opportunities for students to develop leadership skills, explore the arts, and become confident in using technology. We also teach our students the importance of using their talents to help others, helping them grow into caring, responsible individuals.\n\nAt P.S. 120Q, we believe that every child should leave our school feeling confident and capable. We focus on helping students develop important life skills like teamwork, creative thinking, and digital literacy, which will prepare them for future challenges.\n\nOur main focus is on strengthening reading and writing skills by building vocabulary and teaching phonics. We closely track each student\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s progress so we can provide the right support, especially for those who are learning English, ensuring that every child is given the tools they need to succeed.","start_time":"8:00 AM","end_time":"2:20 PM","language